      PVAR←'new'
      )PCOPY PCOPY_tc.apl
DUMPED ³

      ⍝ PVAR must still be 'new' (protected: not overwritten by the 'old'
      ⍝ value from PCOPY_tc.apl)
      PVAR
new

      )DROP PCOPY_tc.apl
³

